  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The cause is a legacy design issue which failed to recognize the Normal and Alternate Feeders share the same breaker on the associated 480V shutdown board (2-BD-212-A1-A and 2-BD-212-A2-A). Design Change 54192 issued in 2010 during Unit 2 completion rerouted and wrapped the Normal Feeder but did not include the Alternate Feeder.",
